### 1. Login to Supabase and get Access Token
# @name login

POST {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token?grant_type=password
Content-Type: application/json
apikey: {{anonKey}}

{
    "email": "{{email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}


### 2. Get Kanban Board for a Specific Project

GET {{baseUrl}}/{{kanbanEndpoint}}/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json